hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1107","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne aik aadmi ko aayat padhtey huey suna jo main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se uskey khilaaf suni thi. To main ne uska haath pakda aur use Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas laaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum donon achha kar rahey ho. Shoba ne kaha: Mera khayaal hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Ikhtelaaf na karo, beshak jo tum se pehley they unhon-ne ikhtelaaf kya aur halaak ho gaey. (Bukhari: 2410)"
"1108","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Do aadmi gaali galoch karney lagey: Musalmaanon mein se aadmi aur Yahood mein se aadmi. Musalman ne kaha: Qasam us zaat ki jis ne Muhammad ko jahaanon par muntakhib kya! To Yahoodi ne kaha: Qasam us zaat ki jis ne Musa ko jahaanon par muntakhib kya! To Musalman ne us waqt apna haath uthaaya aur Yahoodi key chehrey par thappad maara. To Yahoodi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas gaya aur Aap ko uskey aur Musalman key muamley ki khabar di jo hua tha. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Musalman ko bulaaya aur us se uskey baarey mein poochha. To us ne Aap ko khabar di. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhey Musa par fazeelat na do. Beshak log Qiyaamat key din behosh hongey aur main unkey sath behosh hunga. To main sab se pehla hunga jo hosh mein aaeyga. Phir Musa Arsh key pehlu ko pakdey huey hongey. To mujhey nahi maloom ke wo un mein they jo behosh huey aur mujh se pehley hosh mein aey ya un mein they jinhey Allah ne mustasna kya. (Bukhari: 2411)"
"1109","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Yahoodi ne londi ka sar do pattharon key darmiyaan kuchal diya. Kaha gaya: Tumharey sath ye kis ne kya? Fulaan ne, fulaan ne? Yahan tak ke Yahoodi ka naam liya gaya. To us ne apne sar se ishaara kya. To Yahoodi pakda gaya aur us ne iqraar kya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uskey baarey mein hukm diya aur uska sar do pattharon key darmiyaan kuchal diya gaya. (Bukhari: 2413)"
"1110","[AI-translation] Ashas ki hadees qareeb guzar chuki hai. Aur us mein zikr kya ke us ne aur Hazramaut walon mein se aik aadmi ne jhagda kya. Aur is riwayat mein kaha: Beshak wo aur Yahoodi they. (Bukhari: 2417). Gumshuda cheez key uthaanay ki kitaab."
